          "content": {
            "size": 4550,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\":items\":{\"responsivegrid\":{\":items\":{\"text\":{\"styleClasses\":[],\":type\":\"spectrum/buyflow-business/components/text\",\"text\":\"<p><b><span class=\\\"font-size-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-28\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-24\\\">How It Works</span></span></span></span></b></p>\\r\\n<p><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-18\\\">The new Apple TV 4K lets you watch shows and movies with stunning 4K Dolby Vision, HDR10+ and Dolby Atmos spatial audio. Watch your favorites and stream live TV with the Spectrum TV® App, plus enjoy access to Apple TV+ and other streaming services.</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p><b>&nbsp;</b></p>\\r\\n<p><b><span class=\\\"font-size-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-28\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-24\\\">Apple TV Return Restrictions</span></span></span></span></b></p>\\r\\n<p><span class=\\\"font-size-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-18\\\"><span class=\\\"font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-18\\\">Sales of Apple TV are final upon opening the packaging.&nbsp;Unopened Apple TVs returned within 30 days of shipment will receive a full refund for amounts paid. Returns should be made through UPS stores.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p><b><span class=\\\"font-size-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-28\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-24\\\">Please Note</span></span></span></span></b></p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li style=\\\"list-style-image: url(/content/dam/spectrum/buyflow-residential/icons/checkmark.svg); text-align: left;\\\" class=\\\"font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-18\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-Light\\\">Not all channels are compatible with Apple TVs</span></span></li>\\r\\n<li style=\\\"list-style-image: url(/content/dam/spectrum/buyflow-residential/icons/checkmark.svg); text-align: left;\\\" class=\\\"font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-18\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-18\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-Light\\\">Apple TV is compatible with Cloud DVR Service only</span></span></span></span></li>\\r\\n<li style=\\\"list-style-image: url(/content/dam/spectrum/buyflow-residential/icons/checkmark.svg); text-align: left;\\\" class=\\\"font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-18\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-18\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-Light\\\">See <u>S<a href=\\\"http://www.spectrum.com/appletvfaq\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(51,51,51);\\\">pectrum.com/AppleTVFAQ</a></u>&nbsp;for complete details</span></span></span></span></li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-18\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-Regular\\\"><span class=\\\"font-size-12\\\"><span><img src=\\\"/content/dam/spectrum/buyflow-residential/device-images/Apple_TV_4K_Siri_Remote_Pure_Front_Screen__USEN.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-11\\\">Subscription may be required to access some content. Not all content is available in 4K HDR formats. 4K resolution requires 4K-capable TV. Title and app availability are subject to change. Some apps are not available in all areas. Dolby Atmos features require Dolby Atmos-capable devices and may not be available for all titles and languages. If associated Spectrum services are disconnect, the remainder of the Apple TV balance will be due in full immediately.</span></span></ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n\",\"id\":\"text-316a0d4337\",\"richText\":true}},\"allowedComponents\":{\"components\":[],\"applicable\":false},\":type\":\"wcm/foundation/components/responsivegrid\",\":itemsOrder\":[\"text\"],\"columnClassNames\":{\"text\":\"aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12\"},\"gridClassNames\":\"aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12\",\"columnCount\":12}},\"cq:styleIds\":[\"1603477678354\"],\"styleClasses\":[\"cmp-modal--resi-agent-buyflow\"],\"resourceId\":\"modal-84fa0a52d5\",\":type\":\"spectrum/buyflow-business/components/modal\",\":itemsOrder\":[\"responsivegrid\"],\"textIsRich\":\"true\",\"sling:resourceType\":\"spectrum/buyflow-business/components/modal\",\"shouldStopClickEvents\":false,\"richtext\":\"<p><u><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-14\\\">Apple TV return restrictions and important details</span></u></p>\\r\\n\",\"id\":\"\",\"headerTitle\":\"Apple TV 4K\"}"
          },
