          "content": {
            "size": 3005,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"cq:styleIds\":[\"1603477678354\"],\"styleClasses\":[\"cmp-modal--resi-agent-buyflow\"],\"resourceId\":\"modal-5d9aa49864\",\"textIsRich\":\"true\",\"sling:resourceType\":\"spectrum/buyflow-business/components/modal\",\":items\":{\"responsivegrid\":{\":items\":{\"text\":{\"styleClasses\":[],\":type\":\"spectrum/buyflow-business/components/text\",\"text\":\"<p><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-44\\\">Business Connect</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-28\\\">Special Offer!</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Light\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-18\\\"><i>Add Business Connect and select 2 or more seats to receive a Business Voice line FREE!</i></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p>Business Connect is a cloud-based phone system combining messaging, video conferencing and phone calls into one unified platform with RingCentral. With desktop and mobile apps, Business Connect easily syncs across all devices, keeping teams and customers connected from everywhere.</p>\\r\\n<p><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Regular\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-12\\\">A Business Internet plan is required to add Business Connect. Business Connect must remain active to maintain free Business Voice line.</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-28\\\">Benefits</span></span><br>\\r\\n</p>\\r\\n<p><li style=\\\"list-style-image: url(/content/dam/spectrum/buyflow-residential/icons/checkmark.svg);\\\">Simplify communication with messaging, video and phone calls within RingCentral’s seamless system</li>\\r\\n<li style=\\\"list-style-image: url(/content/dam/spectrum/buyflow-residential/icons/checkmark.svg);\\\">Streamline workflows with team chats, file sharing, unlimited 1-click video meetings and task management</li>\\r\\n<li style=\\\"list-style-image: url(/content/dam/spectrum/buyflow-residential/icons/checkmark.svg);\\\">Build a custom enterprise phone system based in the cloud</li>\\r\\n<li style=\\\"list-style-image: url(/content/dam/spectrum/buyflow-residential/icons/checkmark.svg);\\\">Add on desksets, conference phone, receptionist phone and other helpful equipment</li>\\r\\n</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n\",\"id\":\"text-d28a0c0e5d\",\"richText\":true}},\"allowedComponents\":{\"components\":[],\"applicable\":false},\":type\":\"wcm/foundation/components/responsivegrid\",\":itemsOrder\":[\"text\"],\"columnClassNames\":{\"text\":\"aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12\"},\"gridClassNames\":\"aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12\",\"columnCount\":12}},\":type\":\"spectrum/buyflow-business/components/modal\",\":itemsOrder\":[\"responsivegrid\"],\"showOnLoad\":false,\"footerType\":\"default\",\"shouldStopClickEvents\":false,\"richtext\":\"<p><u><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Regular\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-12\\\">See details</span></span></u></p>\\r\\n\",\"id\":\"\",\"isUseCenteredFlag\":false,\"headerTitle\":\"See details\"}"
          },
