          "content": {
            "size": 2865,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"cq:styleIds\":[\"1603477678354\"],\"styleClasses\":[\"cmp-modal--resi-agent-buyflow\"],\"resourceId\":\"modal-ce34b0219a\",\"textIsRich\":\"true\",\"sling:resourceType\":\"spectrum/buyflow-business/components/modal\",\":items\":{\"responsivegrid\":{\":items\":{\"text\":{\"styleClasses\":[],\":type\":\"spectrum/buyflow-business/components/text\",\"text\":\"<p><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Medium\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-44\\\">Spectrum Mobile for Business&nbsp;</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p>When you add Spectrum Mobile to your Business Internet plan, you’ll get one Unlimited line included at no extra cost for one year – and you’ll automatically save $15/month on your total order.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-28\\\">Benefits:&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<ul style=\\\"list-style: disc; line-height: 1.8;\\\">\\r\\n<li><b><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\">Exclusive savings</span></b></b></b> with one Unlimited Mobile line included for 12 months</li>\\r\\n<li><b><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\">Coast-to-coast connectivity</span></b></b></b> with reliable nationwide 5G coverage</li>\\r\\n<li><b><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\">No data caps</span></b></b></b> with unlimited talk, text and data</li>\\r\\n<li><b><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\">Transparent pricing</span></b></b></b> with no contracts or hidden fees</li>\\r\\n<li><b><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><b data-rte-class=\\\"rte-temp\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-SemiBold\\\">Customizable plans</span></b></b></b> to easily add more lines and meet business needs</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n\",\"id\":\"text-d3475f35b5\",\"richText\":true}},\"allowedComponents\":{\"components\":[],\"applicable\":false},\":type\":\"wcm/foundation/components/responsivegrid\",\":itemsOrder\":[\"text\"],\"columnClassNames\":{\"text\":\"aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12\"},\"gridClassNames\":\"aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12\",\"columnCount\":12},\"button_container\":{\":items\":{},\"allowedComponents\":{\"components\":[],\"applicable\":false},\":type\":\"wcm/foundation/components/responsivegrid\",\":itemsOrder\":[],\"columnClassNames\":{},\"gridClassNames\":\"aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12\",\"columnCount\":12}},\":type\":\"spectrum/buyflow-business/components/modal\",\":itemsOrder\":[\"responsivegrid\",\"button_container\"],\"showOnLoad\":false,\"footerType\":\"default\",\"shouldStopClickEvents\":false,\"shouldHideHeader\":false,\"richtext\":\"<p><u><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-family-Regular\\\"><span class=\\\"cmp-text--font-size-12\\\">See details</span></span></u></p>\\r\\n\",\"id\":\"\",\"isUseCenteredFlag\":false}"
